# SHA-256 of every whole file the operator scripts download (bin/tiles-dev.sh
# rivers | water, bin/evaporation-fetch.sh), checked after each download by
# scripts/guards/source_checksums.mjs. None of these publishers offers a
# checksum (docs/maps.md § Sources), so these are ours, recorded on 2026-10-03
# (HydroRIVERS' zip and the 20E_30S tile also matched a fetch the day before).
# A file not listed is
# recorded here on its first fetch; commit the line. Never edit a line to make
# a mismatch pass unless the publisher has confirmed a re-issue.
#
